<p data-imt-p=3D"1">There are many ways to decrease a champion's movement s=
peed, with the most usual one being through champion abilities. For a full =
list of slows, see <a href=3D"https://wiki.leagueoflegends.com/en-us/Types_=
of_Crowd_Control/Sources#Slow" title=3D"Types of Crowd Control/Sources">Typ=
es of Crowd Control/Sources#Slow</a>.
</p><p data-imt-p=3D"1">Movement speed can also be decreased by negative bu=
ff values (e.g. by having a negative <a href=3D"https://wiki.leagueoflegend=
s.com/en-us/Stat" class=3D"mw-redirect" title=3D"Stat">stat</a> scaling wit=
h it) down to 0 (ignoring the <span style=3D"color: #9FFF4D; white-space:no=
rmal"><span style=3D"white-space:nowrap"><span typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=
