t speed"><img src=3D"https://wiki.leagueoflegends.com/en-us/images/thumb/Mo=
vement_speed_icon.png/15px-Movement_speed_icon.png?f928e" decoding=3D"async=
" loading=3D"lazy" width=3D"15" height=3D"15" class=3D"mw-file-element" dat=
a-file-width=3D"72" data-file-height=3D"72"></a></span>&nbsp;110 movement s=
peed</span></span> floor that <span class=3D"glossary tooltips-init-complet=
e" style=3D"white-space:pre; position:relative;" data-game=3D"lol" data-tip=
=3D"Slows"><span typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https://wiki.leagueoflegends=
.com/en-us/Slow"><img alt=3D"An icon representing the keyword Slow" src=3D"=
https://wiki.leagueoflegends.com/en-us/images/thumb/Slow_icon.png/20px-Slow=
_icon.png?2e57e" decoding=3D"async" loading=3D"lazy" width=3D"20" height=3D=
"20" class=3D"mw-file-element" data-file-width=3D"65" data-file-height=3D"6=
